      "Option B ✅ (ĐÚNG): Subagents do not share memory. The coordinator must explicitly pass the complete research output to the synthesis agent. If the coordinator only passes a summary, the synthesis agent has no access to the detailed findings and will rely on its training data to fill gaps, potentially contradicting the actual research.",
