    "questionEN": "The data platform's query_snowflake tool has a description that reads: 'Queries Snowflake data warehouse. Accepts SQL.' The agent correctly uses the tool but frequently sends queries using PostgreSQL-specific syntax (e.g. string_agg, which Snowflake spells LISTAGG) that Snowflake rejects. What is the most effective fix?",
