      "Option B ✅ (ĐÚNG): The tool successfully queried the data source and found no matches. This is a valid empty result, not an access failure. The agent's recovery logic cannot distinguish the two, causing it to retry when it should accept the result.",
      "Option C ❌ (SAI): The problem is not the escalation threshold. The problem is that the agent retries at all. A valid empty result requires no retry and no escalation.",
