    "scenarioId": "s-q-2-4-002",
    "questionEN": "A customer support team configures an MCP server for their internal CRM system. The agent frequently ignores the CRM MCP tool and instead uses the built-in Grep tool to search local log files for customer information, producing incomplete results. The MCP tool's description reads: 'CRM tool'. What should the team do first?",
