    "questionEN": "A consultancy works across 12 client projects simultaneously. Each developer has personal preferences (editor keybindings, alias shortcuts) and the consultancy has firm-wide coding standards. Each client project has its own specific conventions. Some client projects have subsystems with additional specialised rules. What is the correct configuration architecture?",
