    "questionEN": "An extraction pipeline uses `tool_use` with a 15-required-field schema. For some document types, only 8 of those fields ever appear in the source material. The model consistently fabricates plausible values for the missing 7, and the instruction 'do not fabricate data' has not helped. Should the team (A) keep all fields required and add post-extraction validation, or (B) redesign the schema? Which is correct and why?",
