      "Option B ✅ (ĐÚNG): A policy gap is one of the valid escalation triggers: when policy is ambiguous or silent on the customer's specific request, the agent cannot know the company's intended answer, however simple the case looks. Competitor price matching when policy only addresses own-site adjustments is the guide's own example.",
