    "questionEN": "A developer has been using the data platform agent in a single extended session for two hours, running complex federated queries, debugging SQL syntax, and iterating on report formatting. The agent now produces noticeably worse SQL and occasionally references table schemas from earlier queries that have since been corrected. What is the most effective intervention?",
