      "Option A ✅ (ĐÚNG): Extended sessions cause context degradation as stale information (outdated schemas, abandoned approaches) competes with current context. /compact summarises the conversation history into a compressed form, freeing context budget. The optional [instructions] argument lets you bias the summary (for example, 'preserve the corrected schema for the orders table'). It is the documented mitigation for context degradation in long sessions, and the least disruptive option of the four.",
