      "Option B ✅ (ĐÚNG): Stratified sampling allocates review effort proportional to risk. Payment processing documentation has regulatory implications warranting full review. Public data queries affect external users and deserve moderate scrutiny. Internal tooling has the lowest blast radius and can tolerate the lightest review. This achieves thorough coverage of critical content within a manageable review budget.",
